WEBVTT

00:00:01.010 --> 00:00:05.860
I played for a local soccer team in fifth grade or so.

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:09.930
I was fairly passionate about practicing,

00:00:09.930 --> 00:00:10.860
but...

00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:14.130
the sad truth is,

00:00:14.130 --> 00:00:16.370
I wasn't cut out for soccer.

00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:19.650
My uniform remained spotless.

00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:21.730
The guilt from making my parents come watch games,

00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:24.870
when their son didn't get to play,

00:00:24.870 --> 00:00:26.380
led me to quit the team after a year.

00:00:27.870 --> 00:00:30.490
The fact that I no longer envied my friends who got to play

00:00:30.490 --> 00:00:33.000
was also part of my decision to quit.

00:00:34.330 --> 00:00:37.890
I realized that I'd become resigned to the situation.

00:00:42.120 --> 00:00:42.850
Ah!

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:58.950
It was about then that I stopped trying for goals out of my immediate reach.

00:02:33.840 --> 00:02:37.720
Daytime is the most boring part of the day.

00:02:39.010 --> 00:02:41.140
Erio helps out at the Tamura shop.

00:02:41.140 --> 00:02:43.050
Meme-san is at work, more or less.

00:02:43.050 --> 00:02:44.560
Ryuushi-san has club activities,

00:02:44.560 --> 00:02:46.600
and Maekawa-san is probably working part-time.

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:49.980
Those things have varying degrees of importance, but they're all something to do.

00:02:50.560 --> 00:02:52.230
Am I the only one...

00:02:52.230 --> 00:02:54.230
with nothing going on in my life?

00:02:58.700 --> 00:03:00.360
I don't wanna go outside.

00:03:11.210 --> 00:03:12.130
Huh?

00:03:13.170 --> 00:03:14.380
Hey, transfer student.

00:03:15.170 --> 00:03:16.710
Are you going somewhere?

00:03:16.710 --> 00:03:18.550
I'm on my way home from a delivery.

00:03:18.550 --> 00:03:19.720
What about you?

00:03:19.720 --> 00:03:21.760
I was thinking of grabbing some food.

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:28.060
Why don't you come over? I'll treat you to lunch.

00:03:28.770 --> 00:03:30.980
An excellent chance for adolescence points!

00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:34.900
Can you let me try riding in that bike basket?

00:03:35.730 --> 00:03:37.940
It must be a heavenly ride,

00:03:37.940 --> 00:03:40.990
seeing as how Touwa is obsessed with it!

00:03:46.030 --> 00:03:47.540
How's the ride?

00:03:47.540 --> 00:03:50.000
I feel like a cow on a wagon.

00:03:50.540 --> 00:03:52.870
Donna Donna Do...

00:03:55.710 --> 00:03:58.630
I wonder if they went to prep the bar.

00:03:58.630 --> 00:04:02.380
Oh, my parents run a bar.

00:04:02.380 --> 00:04:03.260
Did I tell you that already?

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:08.640
Thanks for waiting.

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:24.360
What, you don't recognize this?

00:04:24.360 --> 00:04:26.370
Such a boring guy.

00:04:26.370 --> 00:04:28.830
That was cosplay?

00:04:43.090 --> 00:04:44.180
Hey!

00:04:44.180 --> 00:04:46.470
Ha- ha- ha.

00:04:46.470 --> 00:04:50.770
I- knew- you- would- come—

00:04:50.770 --> 00:04:51.350
My throat...

00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:54.980
Trespassing again? And stealing tomatoes on top of that.

00:04:54.980 --> 00:04:57.100
I-It's "to-MAY-to"!

00:04:57.100 --> 00:05:00.150
Who asked you to correct my pronunciation?

00:05:00.150 --> 00:05:02.030
Go home already.

00:05:02.030 --> 00:05:04.990
I wish I could.

00:05:08.950 --> 00:05:10.280
Wait here.

00:05:20.210 --> 00:05:21.800
Well?

00:05:21.800 --> 00:05:24.090
Did you give in to hunger?

00:05:25.680 --> 00:05:27.430
Uh, um...

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:29.180
Could I have some tomatoes?

00:05:30.430 --> 00:05:32.180
See, there's a cat in the backyard,

00:05:32.180 --> 00:05:35.690
and it's scratching at the window, asking for tomatoes...

00:05:36.350 --> 00:05:38.270
I don't really mind.

00:05:41.110 --> 00:05:44.900
I thought for a second your love for veggies had awakened, like Ryuushi's.

00:05:46.650 --> 00:05:47.860
Here.

00:05:55.540 --> 00:05:57.960
<i>Dream</i> gratitude!

00:05:57.960 --> 00:06:00.170
Show your gratitude in reality.

00:06:00.170 --> 00:06:03.630
Pirorirorin! Death Evasion Points have increased!

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:05.920
Makoto's Life Force has increased by 5.

00:06:05.920 --> 00:06:09.050
Let's not start playing some mysterious game.

00:06:24.530 --> 00:06:26.570
You've gotten what you came for, so please leave now.

00:06:30.200 --> 00:06:32.580
I shall return this favor with a favor.

00:06:32.580 --> 00:06:34.370
Rejoice.

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:35.750
Gee, thanks.

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:42.000
What's with her?

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:44.300
Thanks for waiting. I made fried udon.

00:06:52.260 --> 00:06:53.850
Thanks.

00:06:58.480 --> 00:07:00.350
How is it?

00:07:00.350 --> 00:07:03.690
Hmm... the smoothness of this...

00:07:03.690 --> 00:07:06.030
No, an ordinary comment is fine.

00:07:06.030 --> 00:07:07.280
Really?

00:07:07.280 --> 00:07:09.450
Then, I'll praise you in a common way.

00:07:09.450 --> 00:07:11.410
It's really delicious.

00:07:12.410 --> 00:07:14.330
Do you want to play some video games later?

00:07:14.330 --> 00:07:17.160
Sure! I didn't know you played video games.

00:07:17.950 --> 00:07:21.330
I used to play a lot, before I got so tall.

00:07:25.420 --> 00:07:29.970
Now I understand why Hanazawa-san said this taste made her want to marry into your family.

00:07:33.050 --> 00:07:34.300
Come in.

00:07:41.560 --> 00:07:45.060
My closet is like a dream wonderland inside.

00:07:45.060 --> 00:07:46.320
Would you like to have a look?

00:07:46.320 --> 00:07:48.400
No, thanks.

00:07:56.530 --> 00:07:57.660
Oh, shoot!

00:07:59.910 --> 00:08:03.790
The transfer student seems to be good at giving up.

00:08:03.790 --> 00:08:05.920
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:08:05.920 --> 00:08:11.550
You tend to start everything with denial, so I thought you'd be giving up a lot.

00:08:12.170 --> 00:08:13.550
I don't know...

00:08:13.550 --> 00:08:15.970
For example,

00:08:15.970 --> 00:08:19.930
the transfer student has already given up on hitting Hanazawa's pitches.

00:08:21.270 --> 00:08:23.270
Well, that's....

00:08:23.270 --> 00:08:24.560
I guess so.

00:08:24.560 --> 00:08:28.940
Attending the summer festival will be awkward if you lose.

00:08:28.940 --> 00:08:30.400
Have you heard about that?

00:08:30.400 --> 00:08:34.070
The right to host the festival goes to whoever wins the final game.

00:08:34.070 --> 00:08:36.820
Yeah, Ryuushi-san told me.

00:08:36.820 --> 00:08:40.160
Don't you want to go with Ryuushi and Touwa?

00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:45.750
Erio aside... that's very tempting.

00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:47.380
What about you?

00:08:47.380 --> 00:08:49.590
I'll be helping out at our stall.

00:08:49.590 --> 00:08:53.880
If the shopping district team loses, I'll be watching the fireworks from my yard.

00:08:53.880 --> 00:08:58.640
We're getting a bit off topic, but I tend to give up very easily.

00:08:58.640 --> 00:09:01.100
I've already given up on my height.

00:09:01.680 --> 00:09:04.980
It's impossible to conceal a height of 179.9 cm.

00:09:04.980 --> 00:09:07.900
Aren't you obsessing too much about it?

00:09:07.900 --> 00:09:10.940
I've already accepted my being abnormally tall.

00:09:10.940 --> 00:09:12.530
It's just that lately,

00:09:12.530 --> 00:09:14.530
I can't completely get into spectator mode,

00:09:14.530 --> 00:09:17.110
although I thought I'd already given up on so many things.

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:21.700
Yet look at where I am now.

00:09:21.700 --> 00:09:26.290
Oh, you got too obsessed with something else, and lost the lead.

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:30.210
Maybe I'm not in a position to be making fun of others.

00:09:30.210 --> 00:09:32.960
You'll be in last place if I get past you.

00:09:33.760 --> 00:09:36.800
Is it fun playing with me like this, transfer student?

00:09:36.800 --> 00:09:38.930
Yeah, it's fun.

00:09:38.930 --> 00:09:42.970
I see. Then I don't have to give up yet.

00:09:42.970 --> 00:09:46.140
We're still on the first lap. It's not too late.

00:09:46.140 --> 00:09:47.730
Right.

00:09:47.730 --> 00:09:51.020
I just want to say it's hard to give up on some things.

00:09:53.780 --> 00:09:55.150
By the way...

00:09:55.150 --> 00:09:56.150
Yeah?

00:09:56.150 --> 00:09:58.820
I'm still a "transfer student"?

00:09:59.950 --> 00:10:04.500
The way you address me... I think that status is about to expire.

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:09.420
Hmm... it's kind of embarrassing to change the way I address you now.

00:10:09.420 --> 00:10:10.380
Why?

00:10:10.880 --> 00:10:11.960
Just because!

00:10:12.590 --> 00:10:15.880
Even Maekawa-san has her pride, you know.

00:10:21.140 --> 00:10:24.680
I actually wanted to introduce you to my parents.

00:10:24.680 --> 00:10:26.100
Please let me off the hook.

00:10:27.390 --> 00:10:29.100
I'm just kidding!

00:10:29.100 --> 00:10:30.350
So...

00:10:30.350 --> 00:10:31.980
Uh... um...

00:10:34.480 --> 00:10:36.940
Can I invite you over again,

00:10:36.940 --> 00:10:37.990
Kiwa-kun?

00:10:37.990 --> 00:10:41.450
As long as you don't call me by that name.

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:43.450
Should I bring Ryuushi-san and Erio too?

00:10:43.450 --> 00:10:45.160
No, uh...

00:10:45.160 --> 00:10:48.250
I only have two controllers for the game.

00:10:49.080 --> 00:10:51.460
Well, that's true...

00:10:51.460 --> 00:10:53.210
Don't read too much into it!

00:10:53.210 --> 00:10:57.510
Basically, I like being praised for my cooking.

00:10:57.510 --> 00:10:59.340
Oh, I see.

00:10:59.340 --> 00:11:01.220
Bye now.

00:11:02.970 --> 00:11:04.970
Okay, see you tomorrow.

00:11:05.680 --> 00:11:09.770
Let's see the Maekawa-san-fish by the riverbank.

00:11:17.110 --> 00:11:20.490
Pirorirorin! Adolescence points have increased by 3.

00:11:23.620 --> 00:11:24.620
Finally! The match is tomorrow.

00:11:24.620 --> 00:11:27.750
It's at 1 PM, in the gym.

00:11:27.750 --> 00:11:30.330
A reasonable time and distance from home!

00:11:30.330 --> 00:11:33.920
That's great! Is it for the summer tournament?

00:11:33.920 --> 00:11:36.710
We already lost that game last month.

00:11:36.710 --> 00:11:39.010
Tomorrow's just a practice game.

00:11:39.010 --> 00:11:40.510
Oh, I see.

00:11:40.510 --> 00:11:42.510
Your team lost.

00:11:42.510 --> 00:11:43.930
We're really weak!

00:11:44.760 --> 00:11:47.560
We lose in the first round every year!

00:11:47.560 --> 00:11:49.930
Pardon me for asking,

00:11:49.930 --> 00:11:53.190
but how was Ryuushi-san's peformance on the losing team every year?

00:11:53.190 --> 00:11:55.060
It's Ryuuko!

00:11:55.060 --> 00:12:00.190
Well, you know, Ryuuko-san always wears 50 kg wrist weights during practice.

00:12:00.190 --> 00:12:03.360
They tend to underestimate my speed!

00:12:03.360 --> 00:12:05.620
But she's a kind girl!

00:12:05.620 --> 00:12:08.950
What are you, the Red Ogre by the mountain?

00:12:08.950 --> 00:12:12.870
Look forward to Ryuuko-san finally revealing her muscular figure!

00:12:14.420 --> 00:12:15.580
Okay, I'll look forward to—

00:12:15.580 --> 00:12:17.800
Cousin! Let's go see the stars!

00:12:18.960 --> 00:12:19.630
Cousin?

00:12:20.460 --> 00:12:22.090
Niwa-kun? What's wrong?

00:12:22.090 --> 00:12:23.430
You got all silent.

00:12:23.430 --> 00:12:27.470
Uh... I'll get... to you... in a moment...

00:12:27.470 --> 00:12:31.230
<i>Be quiet!</i> Wait, that's not it.

00:12:31.230 --> 00:12:33.440
<i>Attention please...</i>

00:12:33.440 --> 00:12:37.020
Hold on, I'm getting the dictionary.

00:12:37.020 --> 00:12:38.320
Are you on the phone with someone?

00:12:39.110 --> 00:12:40.530
Who is it?

00:12:41.570 --> 00:12:43.320
Ryuushi-something...

00:12:43.320 --> 00:12:45.110
I guessed right.

00:12:46.160 --> 00:12:48.410
<i>More speak!</i>

00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:51.950
Hm? Niwa-kun, is someone there with you?

00:12:51.950 --> 00:12:56.170
The cousin living with the aunt who takes care of me...

00:12:56.170 --> 00:12:59.500
Touwa-san? Boo!

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:01.550
What kind of reaction was that?

00:13:01.550 --> 00:13:03.630
Cousin, stars...

00:13:03.630 --> 00:13:07.260
Fine, fine! I'll go out with you after this call.

00:13:07.260 --> 00:13:09.680
G-Go out with her?

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:14.730
Warning! That's a ferocious-Niwa-kun, Flower-kun for short!

00:13:14.730 --> 00:13:17.900
You're most likely imagining the wrong thing.

00:13:20.900 --> 00:13:23.150
Sorry, the battery's dying.

00:13:24.150 --> 00:13:26.030
What was that about?

00:13:26.030 --> 00:13:28.530
There's a basketball game tomorrow at school.

00:13:28.530 --> 00:13:31.620
I'm going to cheer her on.

00:13:31.620 --> 00:13:32.870
Wanna come?

00:13:32.870 --> 00:13:34.870
No...

00:13:42.210 --> 00:13:43.960
Are you all right?

00:13:43.960 --> 00:13:45.510
I'm not going!

00:13:45.510 --> 00:13:48.180
Me no like school.

00:13:49.390 --> 00:13:50.850
Want to go see the stars?

00:13:50.850 --> 00:13:52.390
Yes!

00:13:54.100 --> 00:13:55.850
Take that off!

00:13:58.280 --> 00:13:59.100
Strike!

00:14:00.430 --> 00:14:01.710
Strike two!

00:14:03.680 --> 00:14:09.640
As usual, the unenthusiastic look on her face doesn't match the speed of her arm.

00:14:10.980 --> 00:14:12.470
Yashiro's off today?

00:14:19.660 --> 00:14:20.460
Close!

00:14:20.460 --> 00:14:22.210
It was on the same spot.

00:14:27.840 --> 00:14:28.900
Out!

00:14:28.900 --> 00:14:30.110
Now I have a strikeout and a
pop up to second for today.

00:14:32.100 --> 00:14:35.850
I haven't reached first base since I started playing baseball.

00:14:42.770 --> 00:14:44.360
'Sup, Niwa-kun!

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:46.190
I haven't seen you in a while.

00:14:46.190 --> 00:14:49.450
Yeah, I came to see you play.

00:14:49.450 --> 00:14:51.200
Someone's here to see me! Yay!

00:14:53.950 --> 00:14:56.700
Pre-game pressure is killin' me!

00:14:56.700 --> 00:14:59.080
Oh? Is this that rumored boyfriend of yours?

00:14:59.710 --> 00:15:01.420
W-What are you talking about?

00:15:01.420 --> 00:15:03.000
Nong!

00:15:03.000 --> 00:15:04.670
What the heck is "nong"?

00:15:04.670 --> 00:15:06.960
<i>"No!"</i> plus "Wrong!"

00:15:07.970 --> 00:15:09.880
You're really flustered.

00:15:11.090 --> 00:15:12.340
This is Mikki.

00:15:12.340 --> 00:15:13.220
Hi.

00:15:13.220 --> 00:15:14.470
She's that...

00:15:14.470 --> 00:15:16.810
Transfer student, right?

00:15:16.810 --> 00:15:19.980
I see, Ryuushi likes exotic imports, huh?

00:15:19.980 --> 00:15:22.400
Come on, Mikki!

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:26.530
Don't worry, you're a high schooler, it's the season of love!

00:15:26.530 --> 00:15:28.530
I'm devoted to the club!

00:15:28.530 --> 00:15:31.610
Liar! You skip sometimes.

00:15:31.610 --> 00:15:33.660
To hang out with the transfer student, right?

00:15:33.660 --> 00:15:37.540
What? You skip practice too, sometimes!

00:15:37.540 --> 00:15:39.500
I'm just a slacker!

00:15:39.500 --> 00:15:40.620
It's nothing to brag about!

00:15:41.420 --> 00:15:42.580
What brings you here today?

00:15:42.580 --> 00:15:43.830
Are you here to see Ryuushi?

00:15:44.880 --> 00:15:46.500
He's here to watch the <i>game.</i>

00:15:46.500 --> 00:15:48.510
I see how it is.

00:15:49.510 --> 00:15:54.510
Coach! Ryuushi-chan says she wants to play today because her boyfriend is here!

00:15:54.510 --> 00:15:57.930
Hey! I'm going to earn my playing time with my skills!

00:15:57.930 --> 00:15:59.680
Stop, Mikki!

00:16:00.980 --> 00:16:02.310
Don't laugh!

00:16:02.310 --> 00:16:04.440
Boyfriend, huh?

00:16:05.110 --> 00:16:08.030
Oh well, where should I sit?

00:16:09.530 --> 00:16:11.900
Who's that? Touwa Erio?

00:16:11.900 --> 00:16:13.780
That doesn't look like a futon.

00:16:13.780 --> 00:16:14.660
New costume?

00:16:17.740 --> 00:16:21.620
Hel-lo, res-i-dents- of- Earth!

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:27.000
No, no!

00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:28.210
Gotcha!

00:16:30.800 --> 00:16:34.590
Geez... It's your fault if this planet is destroyed.

00:16:34.590 --> 00:16:38.140
Right, right. What are you doing at a place like this?

00:16:38.140 --> 00:16:39.100
I was watching.

00:16:39.100 --> 00:16:41.770
I was thinking what to do about my assignment while watching.

00:16:41.770 --> 00:16:44.900
That assignment of yours? You should hurry up and do it.

00:16:44.900 --> 00:16:48.070
It's not that simple.

00:16:48.070 --> 00:16:50.480
Rather, I hate it because it's too simple.

00:16:50.480 --> 00:16:52.860
I attempted a roundabout solution,

00:16:52.860 --> 00:16:54.280
but it's not working out.

00:16:56.320 --> 00:16:58.300
By the way, you didn't show up this morning.

00:16:58.300 --> 00:17:01.250
I don't have unlimited free time like you, dumbass!

00:17:01.250 --> 00:17:04.350
Then why did you join the team in the first place?

00:17:05.960 --> 00:17:08.360
The night was lit by the stars.

00:17:08.360 --> 00:17:09.990
I descended towards this planet as...

00:17:09.990 --> 00:17:10.610
Stop!

00:17:11.360 --> 00:17:12.790
Descended?

00:17:12.790 --> 00:17:13.670
Huh?

00:17:13.670 --> 00:17:15.550
Why are you so surprised?

00:17:15.550 --> 00:17:19.740
I'd never imagined you would ask such a dumb question!

00:17:19.740 --> 00:17:22.250
Well, sorry!

00:17:22.250 --> 00:17:23.750
Wait, that was a dumb question?

00:17:24.150 --> 00:17:26.380
It was my third day on the planet.

00:17:26.380 --> 00:17:27.570
She isn't stopping.

00:17:27.570 --> 00:17:33.130
I couldn't adapt to the harsh environment here,
and I was completely exhausted.

00:17:33.790 --> 00:17:37.540
I had no choice but to take one of this planet's blessings of nature

00:17:37.540 --> 00:17:41.030
as I consumed the round plant I discovered in a cultivated field.

00:17:41.030 --> 00:17:42.640
You stole watermelons?

00:17:42.640 --> 00:17:44.640
But I was interrupted.

00:17:45.150 --> 00:17:51.790
It was fiercer and more guile than Earthlings. An unidentified, growling quadruped!

00:17:51.790 --> 00:17:53.280
You've never heard of dogs?

00:17:53.280 --> 00:17:57.080
We fought evenly until I made an opening and escaped.

00:17:57.080 --> 00:18:00.560
I jumped into a river and got carried away by the current.

00:18:00.560 --> 00:18:02.660
You'd make a great ninja.

00:18:02.660 --> 00:18:05.660
Until I finally discovered a space under the eaves!

00:18:06.260 --> 00:18:08.820
I was enervated and used up my last strength.

00:18:08.820 --> 00:18:12.840
I fell asleep, and two days had passed when I woke up.

00:18:12.840 --> 00:18:13.840
Huh?

00:18:14.260 --> 00:18:16.730
I was taken inside a futon.

00:18:16.730 --> 00:18:21.100
I was saved by Nakamura, the guy who maintains the place of worship.

00:18:21.100 --> 00:18:22.850
Oh, from the shrine?

00:18:22.850 --> 00:18:29.130
He offered me plants and told me that he was interested in aliens.

00:18:29.130 --> 00:18:31.600
He's a great guy. Did you thank him?

00:18:31.600 --> 00:18:32.610
I did.

00:18:33.080 --> 00:18:34.650
Don't you get it already?

00:18:34.650 --> 00:18:38.800
He asked me to help the baseball team in return for the plants.

00:18:38.800 --> 00:18:42.040
I could not have survived without the plants.

00:18:42.040 --> 00:18:43.470
It was a fair trade.

00:18:44.300 --> 00:18:50.310
So, "Three days after I ran from home, I stole from a farm under the starry night."

00:18:50.310 --> 00:18:52.930
"I failed and got chased away by the guard dog,

00:18:52.930 --> 00:18:56.630
then Nakamura-san from the shrine saved my life."

00:18:57.150 --> 00:19:02.430
"He said I can have lunch if I joined the baseball team, so I gladly accepted."

00:19:02.430 --> 00:19:04.590
Does that cover everything?

00:19:04.590 --> 00:19:06.750
Are you an idiot?

00:19:06.750 --> 00:19:10.710
Oh, if it isn't the transfer student, and...

00:19:10.710 --> 00:19:13.040
Is she that girl from the baseball game?

00:19:13.040 --> 00:19:14.840
It's the bunch with no potential.

00:19:15.920 --> 00:19:17.710
I didn't know she was such a pretty girl!

00:19:17.710 --> 00:19:19.550
Oh man... man, oh man!

00:19:20.220 --> 00:19:22.050
That hurt!

00:19:23.470 --> 00:19:24.140
Hey.

00:19:25.390 --> 00:19:27.430
Are you here to watch the game?

00:19:27.430 --> 00:19:30.390
Hmm... more like going to a game on a date.

00:19:30.390 --> 00:19:31.440
A date?

00:19:31.440 --> 00:19:34.110
Well, we're going out.

00:19:34.110 --> 00:19:35.320
Yep.

00:19:39.990 --> 00:19:41.700
Let's win this.

00:19:42.990 --> 00:19:45.080
Put this away too.

00:19:46.410 --> 00:19:47.870
Come on!

00:19:52.790 --> 00:19:53.540
Good luck!

00:19:53.540 --> 00:19:54.670
Thanks!

00:19:54.670 --> 00:19:56.920
Ryuushi-san's so heroic!

00:19:56.920 --> 00:19:58.760
It took you this long to realize that?

00:19:58.760 --> 00:20:00.550
Feebleminded Makoto.

00:20:01.760 --> 00:20:03.470
She has the potential.

00:20:03.470 --> 00:20:06.100
She's a person who can go the last few centimeters.

00:20:06.100 --> 00:20:07.180
What are you talking about?

00:20:07.180 --> 00:20:10.980
Well, if she pairs with you, that is.

00:20:10.980 --> 00:20:12.440
You'll see soon enough.

00:20:26.160 --> 00:20:29.120
I wonder if Mifune will get to play?

00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:31.160
This match is so pointless.

00:20:31.160 --> 00:20:32.160
Pointless?

00:20:32.160 --> 00:20:34.750
They can't win no matter how hard they try.

00:20:34.750 --> 00:20:37.960
The team doesn't have the ability to score under pressure.

00:20:41.880 --> 00:20:46.140
But they can't give up, so they keep trying, only to lose again.

00:20:46.140 --> 00:20:48.100
Same as our softball club.

00:20:48.100 --> 00:20:50.220
Do you hate playing for your team?

00:20:50.220 --> 00:20:52.480
I don't, but it's agonizing,

00:20:52.480 --> 00:20:55.850
because I give them false hopes of winning.

00:20:57.860 --> 00:20:58.360
Hmph!

00:21:00.110 --> 00:21:02.860
The third quarter starts the second half of the game.

00:21:02.860 --> 00:21:03.780
Oh!

00:21:03.780 --> 00:21:05.570
Finally.

00:21:05.570 --> 00:21:07.910
I don't expect her to play that well, though.

00:21:07.910 --> 00:21:08.740
Huh?

00:21:08.740 --> 00:21:11.620
Today is her first game.

00:21:11.620 --> 00:21:14.330
None of you have an eye for talent!

00:21:14.330 --> 00:21:19.000
Her speed is excruciatingly low, but she's the type who can advance!

00:21:19.000 --> 00:21:21.050
You're still not making any...

00:21:21.050 --> 00:21:26.050
Listen well. Everyone tries to awaken their super powers by taking that first step.

00:21:26.890 --> 00:21:29.300
It lies a few centimeters out of their reach,

00:21:29.300 --> 00:21:31.600
something that exists just a few steps away from the ordinary.

00:21:33.730 --> 00:21:37.480
Being able to reach it is the first step to awakening your super powers.

00:21:37.480 --> 00:21:39.730
Only a select few ever reach it.

00:21:39.730 --> 00:21:42.070
Everyone else only approaches it.

00:21:42.070 --> 00:21:46.070
Once in a while, there are those with a higher speed than others,

00:21:46.070 --> 00:21:51.540
but they are overwhelmingly likely to give up in the last few centimeters.

00:21:54.540 --> 00:21:56.920
Ryuushi has a low speed, less than half the average,

00:21:56.920 --> 00:22:02.300
advancing very little in a day, a distance no one even notices.

00:22:04.170 --> 00:22:06.970
However, she hasn't given up.

00:22:06.970 --> 00:22:10.890
She's still very much capable of becoming a late-blooming esper.

00:22:11.560 --> 00:22:13.390
That's quite a compliment.

00:22:13.390 --> 00:22:15.850
It was just an honest evaluation.

00:22:15.850 --> 00:22:19.770
I understand what you're trying to say, but I'm not convinced.

00:22:20.940 --> 00:22:23.320
Show me your super powers.

00:22:23.320 --> 00:22:26.150
Then everything you say will have to be true.

00:22:27.530 --> 00:22:28.740
Of course.

00:22:28.740 --> 00:22:30.950
I will show you when I feel like it.

00:22:30.950 --> 00:22:33.200
Keep on praying.

00:22:36.830 --> 00:22:38.210
It's a free throw for Mifune!

00:22:39.210 --> 00:22:40.580
Keep cool!

00:22:40.580 --> 00:22:42.130
You can do it!

00:22:42.130 --> 00:22:44.840
Go for it! Stay calm!
Go, go!

00:22:45.630 --> 00:22:47.970
Now's the time! Use your super powers.

00:22:47.970 --> 00:22:49.760
What? Me?

00:22:49.760 --> 00:22:52.890
Did you come all the way out here just to watch?

00:22:52.890 --> 00:22:55.220
Step up! Advance! Scream out!

00:22:55.220 --> 00:22:59.600
You may be a slow walker, but aren't you also a person aspiring for super powers?

00:23:00.480 --> 00:23:01.940
Do something?

00:23:01.940 --> 00:23:03.940
What can I possibly do?

00:23:06.650 --> 00:23:09.610
Move by your own will, and move others.

00:23:09.610 --> 00:23:13.030
It's the most fundamental super power given to mankind.

00:23:17.660 --> 00:23:20.420
A quitter like me no longer plays on the field.

00:23:21.580 --> 00:23:24.670
But Ryuushi-san, who hasn't given up yet...

00:23:26.420 --> 00:23:28.420
Go! Ryuushi-san!

00:23:35.310 --> 00:23:36.510
Go for it!

00:23:36.510 --> 00:23:38.770
It's really hard to play well!

00:23:38.770 --> 00:23:40.270
It was impossible for me,

00:23:40.270 --> 00:23:41.690
I've always been pessimistic!

00:23:41.690 --> 00:23:45.190
I didn't understand why people cheered for us from the sidelines.

00:23:45.190 --> 00:23:47.400
I still don't know why, honestly.

00:23:47.400 --> 00:23:49.150
But who cares?

00:23:49.150 --> 00:23:50.530
I should've kept practicing.

00:23:50.530 --> 00:23:51.660
I should've given it my all!

00:23:51.660 --> 00:23:54.070
I gave up because I didn't really love the sport,

00:23:54.070 --> 00:23:56.200
But I still regret it!

00:23:56.200 --> 00:23:57.830
So don't quit, Ryuushi-san!

00:23:57.830 --> 00:24:01.690
Show us we didn't have to give up on everything!

00:24:01.690 --> 00:24:04.330
Play so well that you make a lot of people regret quitting!

00:24:04.330 --> 00:24:06.000
So, Ryuushi-san!

00:24:06.000 --> 00:24:07.340
Do your very best!

00:24:14.550 --> 00:24:16.390
My hero!

00:24:16.390 --> 00:24:18.970
Comedy Girl and Gallant Boy.

00:24:22.850 --> 00:24:24.980
It's Ryuuko!

00:24:29.900 --> 00:24:35.240
And so, Ryuushi-san sank two free throws, effortlessly.

00:24:46.840 --> 00:24:48.670
It didn't feel all that bad.

00:24:48.670 --> 00:24:51.920
Don't you mean, "it felt great"?

00:24:51.920 --> 00:24:53.050
Hmm...

00:24:54.260 --> 00:24:55.970
I can't argue with that.

00:26:31.480 --> 00:26:33.360
Being invited to the Maekawa residence: +2

00:26:33.360 --> 00:26:36.610
Maekawa-san's cooking (all three meals!): +3

00:26:36.610 --> 00:26:38.490
Playing video games with Maekawa-san: +2

00:26:38.490 --> 00:26:40.410
Having a good day: +3

00:26:40.410 --> 00:26:41.660
Cheering at the basketball game,

00:26:41.660 --> 00:26:44.870
a moment of adolescence in the gym! (I guess): +3

00:26:44.870 --> 00:26:47.500
Current adolescence points total: +19

00:26:47.500 --> 00:26:49.000
Schizophrenic Girl and Adolescent Boy

00:26:49.330 --> 00:26:53.800
Next time: 0.00000000198 Centimeters Per Second.

00:26:53.800 --> 00:26:55.960
Transfer student, we have an emergency.

00:26:55.960 --> 00:26:57.340
Woohoo! It's adolescence!

00:26:57.340 --> 00:27:00.180
I'm... I'm... the pitcher?
